<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS REVISES UP 1996 OPERATING.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS REVISES UP 1996 OPERATING.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus preliminary results</p>
<p>for financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			36.09 vs   15.66</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  29.60 vs   15.54</p>
<p>    net profit				16.94 vs    9.20</p>
<p>    net sales				500.96 vs  341.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 429.56 vs  301.92</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				14.97 vs    5.93</p>
<p>    other taxes				2.31 vs    0.41</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    12.34 vs    3.59</p>
<p>    financial costs			 18.83 vs    4.24</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is: Optimus SA. Earlier the firm</p>
<p>reported its operating profit for 1996 at 34.51 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
